    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Airtable field names are case-sensitive and must match the values listed above.",
    "The Contacts table receives one row per event from the platform outbox. The same user may appear multiple times with different Event values.",
    "The Actions table uses PATCH with performUpsert on Key. Re-exporting the same plan updates existing rows rather than creating duplicates.",
    "Currency amounts in the Actions table are not used; the Amount field only appears in the Contacts table for purchase/subscription events.",
    "Date/time fields should be stored in ISO 8601 UTC format to avoid ambiguity."
  ]
}
